Lamna Healthcare Company has a clinical knowledge agent that queries an Azure AI Search index with vector queries only. Clinicians search for drug codes, dates, and physician names, and the agent often misses exact matches. The team also wants the most relevant passages ranked at the top before they are passed to the model. You plan to change the query to the following request body.

```json
{
  "search": "DRX-20931",
  "vectorQueries": [
    { "kind": "text", "text": "DRX-20931", "fields": "contentVector", "k": 50 }
  ],
  "queryType": "semantic",
  "semanticConfiguration": "clinical-semantic",
  "top": 10
}
```

For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.
